META SNP - Mutation Effect Prediction Tool

_ In DNA ---> a single letter - swapped / Mutation - predicts if a mutation is harmless ( Neutral ) or harmful ( disease-related )

The workflow - is a combination of four different predictors :

* phD - SNP ( ML, trained on known mutations )
* SIFT ( check evolutionary conversation of AA )
* polyphen - 2 ( looks at protein structure & function )
* SNAP ( checks evolutionary conservation of AA )

--> It uses a meta classifier - for relaible final answer and a confidence score.
Why Imp ?
-study of mutations 
-Crucial in personalized medicine - predicting patient-secific risks.

Applications:
Genomics Projects, Disease Gene Discovery, & Drug Design.
